        retriggerable: false,
        priority: 'immediate',
        npc: [],
        content: `You hold the vessel with the chemical substance. This could very well be the key to stopping the reversal of the process that is taking away your transformation. The mere thought that you can keep… and perhaps even increase… these changes… is it too good to be true? You just have to believe you can do it.<br><br>

You look at the liquid before you. Staring, you half expect some sort of epiphany to hit you like lightning. But then you remember the very transformation you underwent. This has changed your body from its very foundation, and instead of applying science, you realize it would be rather poetic if your new body somehow helped you get to the bottom of this. So you improvise.<br><br>

You hold the canister tight in your fist, and start spinning it. You are decided to somehow centrifuge it in a manner that will distill whatever you need from it - or die trying. And so you swing your arm, faster, and faster, and faster. You get in the zone, and at least in your mind, you feel like you could break the speed of sound, nay, the very speed of light, just churning that damn receptacle until you coax out the missing ingredient.<br><br>

You keep going until your arm hurts. You aren't even sure how long it took. But something feels different. You look through the little window in the canister, and you can clearly see separation - there are now two phases to the substance. You aren't sure which is which, but you set the two aside in different test tubes. The first one seems like a semitranslucid liquid, which tastes slightly bittersweet, but doesn't do anything you can tell. Which leaves the other tube. This one is completely opaque. Maybe that is more meaningful? Right now, it's your last hope for this test so… down the hatch!<br><br>

…<br>
…<br>
…<br>
…<br>
…<br>
…<br>
BAM!<br><br>

THERE IT IS. The final piece of the puzzle. It feels so simple now, so obvious, you almost feel stupid that it took so much effort to figure it out. The image is so vivid in your head that you feel like you've known it all your life. Despite that, you scribble the exact specifications of the chemical compound, with several little other notes. You feel like you are exploding with anticipation, as the steps to get to it feel so achievable you can only wonder how it never occurred to you before. It's like you just remembered your best friend from childhood you used to see everyday that you had somehow forgotten years ago. It's here, and it's within reach.<br><br>

You almost have to force yourself to stop scribbling notes and comments. You know they are unnecessary. You have everything you need to synthesize this bad boy. And it will change everything. Now it's just a matter of actually doing it.<br><br>

The existential shock that your entire life could change just like that - it's overwhelming. But it is there. And now, you have your destiny handed to you.<br><br>

What are you going to do with it?

<span class="important">You unlocked the recipe for the brew to stop the reversal. Check the lab for it.</span>
`
    }
)>>
